Package: god-cosmic
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: CrafterMinecrafter <CrafterMinecrafter@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/god-termux/god-cosmic
Description: COSMIC compositor for god-termux (nested in the Wayland window)
 cosmic-comp (pop-os/cosmic-comp, commit @COMMIT@) built for aarch64 glibc,
 with the god-cosmic launcher. Android has no DRM/KMS, so the compositor runs
 nested (winit backend) inside the god-termux Wayland compositor.
 .
 Commands: god-cosmic start | run COMMAND | status | stop.
